# Safety rules

- Never commit secrets, cookies, credentials, or `.env` files.
- Never force-push `main` unless the user explicitly demands it.
- Do not use destructive git (`reset --hard`, etc.) unless explicitly requested.
- Do not write large models/temp media into the git tree.
- Prefer FrameForge output root for all heavy assets.
- Do not scrape or download copyrighted content in tests; use public CC/PD clips.
